2718\" width=615 height=64 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Broad set of Beliefs lead to high replayability<br></li><li>Dozens of Hours of unlocks and experiences<br></li><li>Command from the Sky or Control your Ruler in 3rd Person<br></li><li>Full Onboarding Experience<br></li><li>Repeatable end-game challenge<br></li><li>Ascend and continue on in the same World<br></li><li>Deep Mod Support utilizing the Steam Workshop<br></li><li>A deep set of updates that bring new twists to your stories!</li></ul>", "short_description": "Harness your Demigod powers to lead a group from rags to riches in this 3D Fantasy Kingdom Management Sim with RPG elements. Command from the sky or take control in 3rd Person to BUILD, BATTLE, and RULE. Navigate a world of interesting Nobles, earn their respect, and decide their Fates.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769420/header.jpg?t=1788222718", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769420/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788222718", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769420/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788222718", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x64 2.3ghz Quad Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 970m<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x64 3ghz Quad Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><s